course: dictionary
lesson: 2428
title: One small word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words are short but have many meanings. Da is one of them. To find the right meaning, read the words around it, which are its context. «Oisin hugged him, and he trusted his da more because he told the truth when it was hard.» Hugged and trusted tell you that da is a person, so da means dad here.
explain: Context can also show you that da is part of a name. «The Mona Lisa by Leonardo da Vinci is a famous painting.» Leonardo da Vinci is a name, and da is not a word for dad in it. Try swapping in dad: "Leonardo dad Vinci" does not make sense, so that meaning is wrong.
explain: Da is also a playful spelling of the word the in online slang, as in «da best». Another language, Russian, uses da to mean yes. Always check the sentence first, then test your meaning. If it still makes sense, you have found the right one.
fact: Context means the words and sentences around a word.
fact: «Da» has several meanings, in slang, dialect and other languages, so check the sentence.
fact: In Ireland, Scotland and Northern England, informal speech, «me da» means my dad.
fact: In Italian and Portuguese, «da» means from or by: Leonardo da Vinci means Leonardo from Vinci.
fact: In Russian, «da» means yes, but Ukrainian for yes is «tak», not «da».
exercise: «Oisin hugged him, and he trusted his da more because he told the truth when it was hard.» In this sentence, what does da mean? | From | The | *Dad | Yes
exercise: In the name Leonardo da Vinci, what does da mean? | Yes | Big | Dad | *From
exercise: In Mandarin, «dà» is one of the first words children learn. What does it mean? | Dad | Yes | *Big | The
test: In the slang «da best», what does da mean? | Dad | Yes | *The | From
test: Ciara from Belfast says, «Me da is making the tea.» Who is making the tea? | A Russian friend | Her mum | Her teacher | *Her dad
exam: Mia says da always means yes, but she is wrong. In «Me da laughed at the joke», what does da mean? | *Dad | Big | Yes | From
